# LF everywhere, so files are identical on every OS (embedded prompts and the
# API specs must be byte-identical). The same file in every Rekku repository
# (Rekku-app/.github).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
